been reduced by the  lengths of the 1.628" o.d.
sections which simulate element clamp plates, which
are 4" L x 2" W x 0.250" thick. These elements are
heavy-duty (120 mph).

This design was optimized for F/R over band > 20 dB,
and SWR over the band < 2:1.
